INDIA POST GDS RECRUITMENT 2026
</div>

<p class="short-info">
India Post Department has released the notification for Gramin Dak Sevak (GDS) Recruitment 2026.
Candidates can apply online for BPM, ABPM and Dak Sevak Posts.
Read official notification carefully before applying.
</p>

